{"source": "align_vo.py (wav2vec2-base-960h CTC)", "lines": [{"text": "This is every plane in the sky, live, right now.", "start": 0.27, "end": 3.55, "words": [{"w": "This", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.54}, {"w": "is", "start": 0.54, "end": 0.64}, {"w": "every", "start": 0.74, "end": 1.11}, {"w": "plane", "start": 1.11, "end": 1.38}, {"w": "in", "start": 1.38, "end": 1.48}, {"w": "the", "start": 1.48, "end": 1.58}, {"w": "sky,", "start": 1.58, "end": 1.91}, {"w": "live,", "start": 2.22, "end": 2.64}, {"w": "right", "start": 3.04, "end": 3.28}, {"w": "now.", "start": 3.28, "end": 3.55}]}, {"text": "Every satellite overhead. Every ship at sea. And it all runs in your browser, for free.", "start": 4.02, "end": 9.91, "words": [{"w": "Every", "start": 4.02, "end": 4.44}, {"w": "satellite", "start": 4.44, "end": 4.93}, {"w": "overhead.", "start": 4.93, "end": 5.42}, {"w": "Every", "start": 5.98, "end": 6.36}, {"w": "ship", "start": 6.36, "end": 6.54}, {"w": "at", "start": 6.54, "end": 6.65}, {"w": "sea.", "start": 6.65, "end": 7.06}, {"w": "And", "start": 7.55, "end": 7.68}, {"w": "it", "start": 7.68, "end": 7.82}, {"w": "all", "start": 7.82, "end": 8.1}, {"w": "runs", "start": 8.1, "end": 8.36}, {"w": "in", "start": 8.36, "end": 8.44}, {"w": "your", "start": 8.44, "end": 8.62}, {"w": "browser,", "start": 8.62, "end": 9.04}, {"w": "for", "start": 9.38, "end": 9.62}, {"w": "free.", "start": 9.62, "end": 9.91}]}, {"text": "It's called God's Eye View, and its tagline says it all: a spy satellite simulator, except the data is real.", "start": 10.42, "end": 17.32, "words": [{"w": "It's", "start": 10.42, "end": 10.61}, {"w": "called", "start": 10.61, "end": 10.98}, {"w": "God's", "start": 10.98, "end": 11.44}, {"w": "Eye", "start": 11.44, "end": 11.62}, {"w": "View,", "start": 11.62, "end": 11.83}, {"w": "and", "start": 12.23, "end": 12.38}, {"w": "its", "start": 12.38, "end": 12.53}, {"w": "tagline", "start": 12.53, "end": 13.1}, {"w": "says", "start": 13.1, "end": 13.34}, {"w": "it", "start": 13.34, "end": 13.44}, {"w": "all:", "start": 13.44, "end": 13.6}, {"w": "a", "start": 14.06, "end": 14.26}, {"w": "spy", "start": 14.26, "end": 14.68}, {"w": "satellite", "start": 14.68, "end": 15.22}, {"w": "simulator,", "start": 15.22, "end": 15.61}, {"w": "except", "start": 16.06, "end": 16.34}, {"w": "the", "start": 16.34, "end": 16.51}, {"w": "data", "start": 16.51, "end": 16.88}, {"w": "is", "start": 16.88, "end": 17.1}, {"w": "real.", "start": 17.1, "end": 17.32}]}, {"text": "It hit number one on GitHub Trending, and it's past 50,000 stars.", "start": 17.9, "end": 22.07, "words": [{"w": "It", "start": 17.9, "end": 18.04}, {"w": "hit", "start": 18.04, "end": 18.28}, {"w": "number", "start": 18.28, "end": 18.72}, {"w": "one", "start": 18.72, "end": 18.88}, {"w": "on", "start": 18.88, "end": 19.04}, {"w": "GitHub", "start": 19.04, "end": 19.42}, {"w": "Trending,", "start": 19.42, "end": 19.72}, {"w": "and", "start": 20.11, "end": 20.24}, {"w": "it's", "start": 20.24, "end": 20.38}, {"w": "past", "start": 20.38, "end": 20.62}, {"w": "50,000", "start": 20.62, "end": 21.46}, {"w": "stars.", "start": 21.46, "end": 22.07}]}, {"text": "Here's what you're actually looking at.", "start": 22.69, "end": 24.11, "words": [{"w": "Here's", "start": 22.69, "end": 22.92}, {"w": "what", "start": 22.92, "end": 23.06}, {"w": "you're", "start": 23.06, "end": 23.28}, {"w": "actually", "start": 23.28, "end": 23.74}, {"w": "looking", "start": 23.74, "end": 24.0}, {"w": "at.", "start": 24.0, "end": 24.11}]}, {"text": "Over 11,000 live aircraft from public flight trackers, with military flights on their own layer.", "start": 24.98, "end": 30.5, "words": [{"w": "Over", "start": 24.98, "end": 25.3}, {"w": "11,000", "start": 25.3, "end": 26.2}, {"w": "live", "start": 26.2, "end": 26.46}, {"w": "aircraft", "start": 26.46, "end": 27.01}, {"w": "from", "start": 27.22, "end": 27.42}, {"w": "public", "start": 27.42, "end": 27.78}, {"w": "flight", "start": 27.78, "end": 28.0}, {"w"