: "Night", "start": 59.37, "end": 59.68}, {"w": "vision.", "start": 59.68, "end": 59.94}, {"w": "Thermal.", "start": 60.44, "end": 60.79}, {"w": "An", "start": 61.31, "end": 61.5}, {"w": "old", "start": 61.5, "end": 61.76}, {"w": "CRT", "start": 61.76, "end": 62.34}, {"w": "screen.", "start": 62.34, "end": 62.58}]}, {"text": "And your browser looks like a surveillance feed from a spy movie.", "start": 63.15, "end": 66.02, "words": [{"w": "And", "start": 63.15, "end": 63.26}, {"w": "your", "start": 63.26, "end": 63.46}, {"w": "browser", "start": 63.46, "end": 63.92}, {"w": "looks", "start": 63.92, "end": 64.1}, {"w": "like", "start": 64.1, "end": 64.24}, {"w": "a", "start": 64.24, "end": 64.34}, {"w": "surveillance", "start": 64.34, "end": 65.0}, {"w": "feed", "start": 65.0, "end": 65.22}, {"w": "from", "start": 65.22, "end": 65.38}, {"w": "a", "start": 65.38, "end": 65.5}, {"w": "spy", "start": 65.5, "end": 65.84}, {"w": "movie.", "start": 65.84, "end": 66.02}]}, {"text": "Zoom in, and cities rise in 3D, built from Google's photorealistic map tiles.", "start": 66.63, "end": 71.78, "words": [{"w": "Zoom", "start": 66.63, "end": 66.96}, {"w": "in,", "start": 66.96, "end": 67.22}, {"w": "and", "start": 67.4, "end": 67.66}, {"w": "cities", "start": 67.66, "end": 68.04}, {"w": "rise", "start": 68.04, "end": 68.4}, {"w": "in", "start": 68.4, "end": 68.51}, {"w": "3D,", "start": 68.9, "end": 69.1}, {"w": "built", "start": 69.5, "end": 69.74}, {"w": "from", "start": 69.74, "end": 69.96}, {"w": "Google's", "start": 69.96, "end": 70.42}, {"w": "photorealistic", "start": 70.42, "end": 71.18}, {"w": "map", "start": 71.18, "end": 71.51}, {"w": "tiles.", "start": 71.51, "end": 71.78}]}, {"text": "Add an OpenAI key, and you can even steer it with your voice.", "start": 72.41, "end": 76.2, "words": [{"w": "Add", "start": 72.41, "end": 72.66}, {"w": "an", "start": 72.66, "end": 72.81}, {"w": "OpenAI", "start": 72.81, "end": 73.42}, {"w": "key,", "start": 73.42, "end": 73.75}, {"w": 